{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Eval.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.not_evaluationPoint_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.not_evaluationPoint_two","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L186-L189","doc":"**A concrete non-model (PROVED).**  `2` is not the QOU evaluation\npoint, so the class is not satisfied by every real. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.not_evaluationPoint_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.not_evaluationPoint_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L179-L184","doc":"**…and it fails at every other real (PROVED).**  This is the content\nthe parameterisation buys: the hypothesis is a real constraint on the\nsupplied point, not a restatement of `q_zero`'s definition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.instCanonical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.instCanonical","kind":"instance","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L172-L177","doc":"**The hypothesis is satisfiable, at `q_zero` (PROVED).**  So\n`[ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint q0]` for an *unspecified* `q0` asserts\nnothing beyond that some point exists; a downstream result must say\nwhich point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint.gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint.gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L165-L170","doc":"**Analytic-continuation regime — PROVED (derived).**  Any\nArchimedean evaluation point is `> 1`, from the pin and\n`q_zero_gt_one`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint.is_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint.is_substrate","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L163-L163","doc":"The evaluation point is the QOU canonical substrate value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint.mk","kind":"ctor","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L161-L161","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ArchimedeanEvaluationPoint","kind":"class","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L154-L163","doc":"**The Archimedean evaluation point.**  `q0` is the substrate value\nat which `evalAtQZero` evaluates; the class asserts of a *given*\n`q0` that it is the QOU canonical one.\n\nOnly the pin is a field.  `q0 > 1` (the analytic-continuation\nregime) was a second field and is derivable from the pin, so it is\na theorem below rather than an assumption a model gets to restate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ratPolyEvalAtQZero_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ratPolyEvalAtQZero_def","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L111-L116","doc":"Substrate-q corollary: rational evaluation simplifies to\n`num.eval q₀ / den.eval q₀` directly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ratPolyEvalAtQZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.ratPolyEvalAtQZero","kind":"def","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L104-L109","doc":"**Rational-polynomial Archimedean evaluation**: evaluate\na ratio of real polynomials at `q = q₀`, given the\ndenominator's non-vanishing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_mul","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L98-L102","doc":"Evaluation is a ring homomorphism (sends `*` to `*`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_add","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L92-L96","doc":"Evaluation is a ring homomorphism (sends `+` to `+`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_X","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_X","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L87-L90","doc":"The variable `X` evaluates to `q₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero_C","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L82-L85","doc":"The constant polynomial evaluates to its constant value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.evalAtQZero","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L77-L80","doc":"**Scalar Archimedean evaluation**: a real polynomial\n`p ∈ ℝ[q]` evaluated at `q = q₀`.  Wraps Mathlib's\n`Polynomial.eval`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L74-L75","doc":"`q_zero ≠ 0`: substrate parameter is non-zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero_pos","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L69-L72","doc":"`q_zero > 0`: positivity of the substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L63-L67","doc":"`q_zero > 1`: the substrate is in the analytic-continuation\nregime where every `[k]_q` is positive and non-vanishing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.ArchimedeanRealization.q_zero","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/ArchimedeanRealization.lean#L46-L61","doc":"The QOU substrate parameter `q₀`.  Bound here to the canonical\n50-digit decimal expansion from\n`computations/full-twist-delta-n2-verification.witness.json::q_0`\n(proton-anchor re-pin, 2026-05-28; see\n`tools/qou-substrate/python/qou_substrate/constants.py::Q_50_DIGIT_STR`).\n\nBumped 2026-06-08 from the previous 5-dps literal `1.10998` to\nmatch the same canonical literal used in\n`QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate.q_0` and\n`QOU.LiftingDescent.H3BraneTowerScaffold.q0` (both 50 dps, both\nlanded in PR #1978). ","signatureChunk":0}]}